{"kind":"table","sheet":"Template","address":"A1:E37","rows":37,"cols":5,"values":[["It is recommended that you do not edit rubrics in spreadsheet format",null,null,null,null],["v1.0-s",null,null,null,null],["Required Game Components",null,null,null,null],["Includes all required game components: D/F/J/K controls, target creation and movement, collision checks, score, timer, tempo/music, missed-note feedback, and game ending.",null,null,null,null],[null,16,12,8,4],[null,"16 points","12 points","8 points","4 points"],[null,"16 pts: Includes all required game components: D/F/J/K controls, target creation and movement, collision checks, score, timer, tempo/music, missed-note feedback, and game ending.","12 pts: Includes most required components, but one or two are missing or incomplete.","8 pts: Includes some required components, but several important parts are missing or incomplete.","4 pts: Game is largely incomplete and includes very few of the required components."],["Programming Structures",null,null,null,null],["Correctly uses events, broadcasts, loops, conditions, variables, and collision checks.",null,null,null,null],[null,16,12,8,4],[null,"16 points","12 points","8 points","4 points"],[null,"16 pts: Correctly uses events, broadcasts, loops, conditions, variables, and collision checks.","12 pts: Uses most required programming structures correctly, with minor errors or incomplete sections.","8 pts: Uses some required structures, but major errors or incomplete scripts affect the program.","4 pts: Uses very few required programming structures or the scripts do not demonstrate the expected programming concepts."],["Game Functionality",null,null,null,null],["Keyboard input, target movement, collision detection, score, timer, missed-note response, and game ending all work correctly.",null,null,null,null],[null,16,12,8,4],[null,"16 points","12 points","8 points","4 points"],[null,"16 pts: Keyboard input, target movement, collision detection, score, timer, missed-note response, and game ending all work correctly.","12 pts: Game works mostly as intended, but errors affect one or two parts of gameplay.","8 pts: Game shows partial functionality, but important errors prevent it from working consistently as intended.","4 pts: Game has very limited functionality or cannot be successfully played."],["Presentation and Code Explanation",null,null,null,null],["Presents 4 complete slides in English, demonstrates the game, includes a readable code screenshot, and accurately explains the script trigger and at least 3 blocks or structures.",null,null,null,null],[null,16,12,8,4],[null,"16 points","12 points","8 points","4 points"],[null,"16 pts: Presents 4 complete slides in English, demonstrates the game, includes a readable code screenshot, and accurately explains the script trigger and at least 3 blocks or structures.","12 pts: Presents and demonstrates the game, but part of the code explanation or slide content is incomplete or unclear.","8 pts: Gives a partial presentation or demonstration and shows limited understanding of the code.","4 pts: Gives little or no presentation or cannot adequately explain how the game code works."],["Questions",null,null,null,null],["Answers all 4 questions correctly and shows clear understanding of the project.",null,null,null,null],[null,16,12,8,4],[null,"16 points","12 points","8 points","4 points"],[null,"16 pts: Answers all 4 questions correctly and shows clear understanding of the project.","12 pts: Answers most questions correctly and shows good understanding.","8 pts: Answers some questions correctly but shows partial understanding.","4 pts: Answers few or no questions correctly and shows limited understanding."],["Punctuality",null,null,null,null],["Finishes on time. Comes prepared to work while working on the project. Uses class time well.",null,null,null,null],[null,5,2,null,null],[null,"5 points","2 points",null,null],[null,"5 pts: Finishes on time. Comes prepared to work while working on the project. Uses class time well.","2 pts: Does not finish on time. Is often unprepared or does not use class time well.",null,null],["Responsibility",null,null,null,null],["Keeps the workspace organized, follows instructions, submits presentation before presentation.",null,null,null,null],[null,5,2,null,null],[null,"5 points","2 points",null,null],[null,"5 pts: Keeps the workspace organized, follows instructions, submits presentation before presentation.","2 pts: Ignores instructions, leaves the workspace disorganized, or does not submit presentation before presentation.",null,null]]}
